# 12. PostgreSQL Python Driver

MLflow needs an appropriate database driver.

For our local exercise:

```bash
pip install psycopg2-binary
```

The driver allows Python database tooling to communicate with PostgreSQL.

For a production deployment, use an approved and maintained driver installation strategy.

